# index2 — a range index with a sorted set
#
# Learn: for numeric queries ("age between 18 and 30") index with a
# sorted set: member = id, score = the value. ZRANGE ... BYSCORE queries
# by value; LIMIT offset count pages through the result (it only works
# together with BYSCORE or BYLEX).
#
# Task: idx:user:age maps user ids to ages. Print the ids of the 2
# youngest users aged 18 to 30 (inclusive), youngest first.
#

ZRANGE idx:user:age 18 30
